PORT=5000
DB_URL=postgres://postgres:1808@localhost:5432/mzaya
JWT_SECRET=supersecretkey
NODE_ENV=development
APP_URL=http://localhost:5000
CONTIPAY_API_KEY=your_contipay_api_key
CONTIPAY_MERCHANT_CODE=your_merchant_code
ZIG_RATE=27.50
```

Update that number whenever RBZ announces a new rate. Once you have a proper RBZ data source we can automate it, but for now the manual `.env` override is the safest approach given how unpredictable ZiG rates can be.

After placing the files and installing `node-cron`, run `npm run dev` — you should see:
```
Database connected successfully
Models synced
[CurrencySync] Daily rate sync job scheduled (08:00 CAT)
Server running on port 5000